positions.description:
Comprehensive experience of preparing architectural design of projects to enhance capability of existing enterprise knowledge management platform which is built on artificial intelligence concepts such as neural networks and machine learning;

Competence to lead discussions with end users and stakeholders, translating their expectations into simple, “easy to use” and “easy to maintain” architecture and functionality;

Developed new products from the ground up as well as providing enhancements to existing platform by integrating third party license product; for example, Optical Character Recognition from Nuance;

Extends capability and supports cloud-first solution developed in .NET 4.5 / ASP.NET / C#.NET / Entity Framework / SQL / Web API / SOAP / HTML / CSS / JavaScript / jQuery / LINQ.

Designed and developed applications using VS Studio 2015, C#, SQL server 2015 on Azure, Google Storage & BigQuery, and Talend ETL. The applications easily integrated with clients' environment and industry leading 3rd party platforms in order to increase campaign engagement and returned on investment. The process updated frequently (weekly/monthly) to dynamically react to changing HCP behaviors;

Developed and maintained ETL (Data Extraction, Transformation and Loading) mappings by creating metadata using Telend to extract the data from multiple source systems that comprise databases like SQL Server, Bigquery, flat files to the Staging area and then to SQL server and/or BigQuery. The data transformation involved stored procedure in order to map and validate data; 

Supported and troubleshooted procedures, process flows, and Talend ETL jobs;

Performed data conversion by creating SQL scripts and stored procedures.

Developed, debugged, troubleshooted, and enhanced Aptify eBusniess component using VS 2013 in order to use maximum functionality for business needs;

Used industry standard latest development tools such as VS 2013, ASP.NET, VB.NET, C#, jQuery, and SQL Server to develop solutions in conjunction with the Aptify Platform (Version 5.1);

Created Import Source and executed in Aptify in order to import, match, and post data;

Developed stand-alone crystal reports and deployed to Aptify;

Performed business analyst services to develop functional and technical requirements, GAP analysis and reporting requirements;

Participated in strategic technology planning;

Worked collaboratively and built strong relationships with clients and team members across the globe (Canada, USA, and India);

Performed other related duties as required or assigned that contribute to the effectiveness of the department and to accomplish strategic goals and objectives;

Provided hands on guidance and support to Aptify business users.

